---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../lib/site.js';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Projects"
  description={`Project references for ${SITE.name}. Each entry is published only once the client has cleared it.`}
>
  <div class="wrap py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl">Projects</h1>

    <div class="prose-body mt-6">
      <p>
        No project references are published here yet. When they are, each entry
        will name the property type, the county, the scope performed, the
        standard it ran under, and the deliverable — and it will appear only
        after the client has cleared it for publication.
      </p>
      <p>
        Much of our work is performed under another firm's contract and
        letterhead. That work stays theirs to describe, so it will not appear on
        this page at all.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you want to know whether we have done work like yours, ask. We will
        tell you what we have done, what we have not, and who can speak to it.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href="/contact/">Ask about relevant experience</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
